> Mystery two lines in crates/bevy_pbr/src/lib at line 423 and **424**
```rust
        render_app.world_mut().observe(add_light_view_entities);
        render_app.world_mut().observe(remove_light_view_entities);
```
The first observer adds `LightViewEntities` to an extracted light, while the second observer despawns the entity if its `LightViewEntities` is removed. This plays into the `crates/bevy_pbr/src/render/light.rs` machinery, which in all honesty I also haven't found the time to fully understand it.

